    <string name="compatibility">Compatibility</string>
    <string name="compatibility_body">Access is limited to folders granted through Android\'s system picker. This app uses the Storage Access Framework, not raw filesystem paths or USB host drivers. Some phones, USB drives, external SSDs, and filesystems may not appear, may be read-only, or may disconnect unexpectedly.</string>
    <string name="foreground_limits">Foreground operation limits</string>
    <string name="foreground_limits_body">Copy, move, delete, and organize operations run while this app remains open. They do not continue after the app is closed, the process is stopped, or Android ends the app. There is no background service.</string>
